===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Honchkrow|94}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
*'''Evil Admonition''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Weavile|74}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

